WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Juri rushes beside the downed Ryu.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.700
Juri withdraws from Ryu’s attempted grab.

3
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.700
Crouching medium punch punishes the missed throw.

4
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.700
Standing heavy punch leads into heavy Fuhajin.

5
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.100
Heavy Tensenrin finishes the meterless continuation.
